<title>USA: 1st Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>1st Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>VINCENNES, Ind. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		$   0.90   profit	$ 0.72</p>
<p> Net loss		     631   profit	   488</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q1 results include one-time charge of $1.3 million for recapitalization of Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding the charge, Q1 earnings would have been about $275,000, or $0.24 a share. Current Q1 results include increased provision for loan losses and lower net interest income.</p>
